{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2021-01-06 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS DECEMBER SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., JAN. 06, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $19.14 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF DECEMBER, THE FIVE WEEKS ENDED JANUARY 3, 2021, AN INCREASE OF 12.3 PERCENT FROM $17.04 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}